      "judgment": "Both exact spy argument edits are confined to the same listener registration/disposal test. The listener event name and function matchers remain; the expectations distinguish omitted, false and explicit undefined arguments. The complete remaining test file is exact. This patch provides no runtime dispatch, event-capture or teardown execution evidence for either supported peer."
