  "decision": "The complete original keyboard-dispatcher patch changes two private test spy expectations: addEventListener capture false becomes undefined, and removeEventListener gains explicit undefined options. It changes no dispatcher implementation or public API. Owned autocomplete/menu/dialog code reaches keyboard events through public CDK overlay APIs, so the dependency is reachable; it is not an absent-package exclusion. The owned package defines no OverlayKeyboardDispatcher fork or matching listener-spy spec. Keep its current public overlay subscriptions and real teardown/keyboard obligations. Do not copy an upstream private spy-arity expectation into product code or claim inherited listener behavior from this test-only patch.",
